{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A helper's TypeScript is in a file beside the page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Code outside the compiler reaches a helper by importing that file."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An importer outside the compiler compiles the helper into its own bundle."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"A helper's exported name is the ECMAScript runtime's rather than akasha's."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The rules refusing a shadowed global name and refusing `any` are off here."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"A helper names an argument for what that argument is rather than for its scope."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The rule refusing a name that shadows an outer name is off here."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/constraint","statement":"A value compared with itself is how the ECMAScript runtime tests for NaN."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The rule refusing a value compared with itself is off here."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"One exported name is one page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page stating no Lua 5.0 code is compiled from its code for every build."}]}
{"definition":"one helper a compiler writes into every addon's Lua"}
